Software Quality Senior Engineer

Role Overview:

As a Senior Software Quality Automation Engineer, you will be a key member of an exciting product development initiative. You will be responsible for performing software testing in a multi-platform environment using cutting-edge technology, including installed security agents, cloud services and microservices. We protect our customers by disrupting attacker tradecraft so we can deny them access to the networks we protect. This is a challenging and also very rewarding position where interesting projects in security are implemented in order to protect our clients from Internet intrusions. The ideal applicant must have strong communication skills, solid analytical and problem solving skills and in-depth knowledge of software automated testing and best practices. Applicant must be highly motivated and willing to work in a team environment with very talented individuals on complex, early-stage development projects.
